{"id":"natu_rlich","lemma":"natürlich","pos":"adv","rank":150,"glosses":["naturally","of course, obviously"],"ipa":"/naˈtyːʁlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b1/De-nat%C3%BCrlich.ogg/De-nat%C3%BCrlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie haben natürlich recht.","en":"Of course, you're right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567135","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},null,{"g":"right, right-hand"}]},{"text":"Natürlich hast du eine Wahl.","en":"Of course, you have a choice.","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"choice, selection"}]},{"text":"Ich bin natürlich gegen den Krieg.","en":"I am against the war, of course.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"war, warfare"}]},{"text":"Natürlich will jeder gewinnen.","en":"Of course, everyone wants to win.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695232","words":[null,{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"to win"}]},{"text":"Natürlich glaube ich dir.","en":"Of course I believe you.","words":[null,{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"}]}]}